msgid "上下文"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:12
#: c637194cec164cfdafa0c59b564c4f96
msgid ""
"`CONTEXT.md` 对 GUI "
"的当前选择文件批量运行覆盖结果有明确约束：支持文件输入的工具可以使用文件树里的当前选择文件，但运行前必须让用户看见并确认；运行前确认用于避免隐式输入、意外批量运行或覆盖结果；发生覆盖结果前，GUI"
" 应显示将被覆盖的文件。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:14
#: a9e5998a1840443ab348777b241f9bf4
msgid "实现层原有三处分散的事实："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:16
#: 53320c999e494f4daa38159faab5ae10
msgid "`_run_from_tab` 在参数校验后直接 `build_run_specs` + `dispatch`（无确认环节）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:17
#: ddad427448aa45c88798be840a2d9aa6
msgid "`file_arg` 在 MainWindow 层静默构造并直接前置到 `extra_args`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:18
#: 8300f10bbca14ab9849cb102b73b7729
msgid "chip 多选通过 `itertools.product` 展开为多个 RunSpec，但用户点击运行前看不到将创建 N 个任务的确认摘要"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:20
#: 209bab1a0649413db5942b738563efdd
msgid "修复目标：在 dispatch 前集中展示工具名、当前选择文件、任务数量/分组、覆盖目标；用户取消时 0 个 Job 创建。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:22
#: 9ae7492761f04b58ad4111011aff32ce
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:24
#: 26771bb573b641c88720db77eda8c2db
msgid "1. 引入 `RunPlan` 数据结构 + `RunConfirmationDialog` 独立类"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:26
#: e0d933325681421faa0345b521fefbbc
msgid ""
"不在 `_run_from_tab` 内直接弹 `QMessageBox`。`RunOrchestrator.build_run_plan` 在 "
"`build_run_specs` 之上叠加覆盖检测与 chip 分组，返回不可变 "
"`RunPlan`；`RunConfirmationDialog.show_and_confirm(plan, parent) -> bool` "
"是 UI 入口，与 orchestrator 完全解耦。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:28
#: ad0bc90672cf45eea57061d99283ff0b
msgid ""
"`RunPlan` / `OverwriteTarget` / `ChipGroup` 全部 `frozen=True` "
"dataclass。`RunPlan` 包含 `entry: ScriptEntry`，避免 dialog 同时依赖 plan + tab。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:30
#: bc31ddade99949caa515590b7392d024
msgid "2. `CliParam.kind` 声明式字段"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:32
#: 2bbfc424ca714f47b2f998c525ab8384
msgid ""
"orchestrator 识别输出文件参数不靠 hardcode `\"--output-file\"` 字符串。新增 `kind: str = "
"\"\"` 字段；`\"file_output\"` 表示该参数的值是输出目标。6 处 `--output-file` 注册点加 "
"`kind=\"file_output\"`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:34
#: dd839cf9b479420384d03a9184ee614b
msgid ""
"未来若脚本同时支持 `--log-file`、`--export-image` 等输出 flag，只需在注册点标 "
"`kind=\"file_output\"`，orchestrator 零改动。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:36
#: 0ece932937214cb09c89b0e8b5877cb0
msgid "3. `dispatch` 签名保持不变"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:38
#: 904420e8c8654c7a9c39522d152625ab
msgid ""
"`build_run_specs` 与 `dispatch` 保留原签名 + 行为；`build_run_plan` 是高层包装，**不**取代 "
"`build_run_specs`。现有 11 个 `test_run_orchestrator.py` 测试在 PR1 后继续 100% 通过。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:40
#: ecb4fbed37ac4008b7e450a6fa0490fe
msgid ""
"覆盖目标路径解析：`(repo_root / p).expanduser().is_file()`，不 `resolve()`，与子进程 cwd "
"行为一致。`--output-file` 为空字符串/纯空白视为未指定输出文件，触发无输出文件参数提示而非覆盖目标。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:42
#: 26d0be49882f44da9573a7d6137537c1
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:44
#: 23aed1384b5c4177a71e70667d037572
msgid "正面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:46
#: d83adffb111246f2bb33fd9ba9b2add9
msgid "GUI 运行路径在 dispatch 前有显式确认环节，与 `CONTEXT.md` 领域约束一致"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:47
#: 094728ed1d53460c97f15f52e3479b55
msgid "覆盖检测、chip 分组逻辑集中在 `RunOrchestrator`，UI 端不持有算法"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:48
#: 258dda3c64294c6193e1aa62a7161a4f
msgid "`RunPlan` frozen dataclass 让 dialog 单元测试可独立进行（widget tree 文本断言）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:49
#: 82551ce80a1b46ce99dd6cfc6a142a01
msgid "现有 GUI 测试套件（PR1 后 461+8 + 8 个新测试）零回归"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:51
#: 6c34ccecb72b45a69840afe8332bdbb3
msgid "负面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:53
#: 7435ae7a413343bb9030f67ac3f3c0ff
msgid ""
"`MainWindow._run_from_tab` 路径多了一处计划构造与确认回调，调用方需使用 build_run_plan 替代 "
"build_run_specs 入口"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:54
#: aaff3c9d8f71468dbb5e460375357137
msgid "`RunConfirmationDialog` 是新组件，未来如果 dialog 还要支持更复杂的 spec 编辑，会变成新的耦合点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:56
#: 591da300a84c40148afe54fd7bda5deb
msgid "后续"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:58
#: c27f6d4e385a4dff8aca23e4f6a2039c
msgid "`_confirm_run_provider` 注入点已就位，但目前没有调用方注入；保留以便未来按工具类别提供不同确认策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-run-preflight-confirmation.md:59
